ang Sung-yoon","character":"Kim Seong-yun","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/1ktApxQaKmAlFDr52JYi2reSL7i.jpg","tmdbId":3206679},{"name":"Bang Yoo-in","character":"Nurse Bang","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/cOwXVmaPnXYCsgSjkrSR2ZtOWQM.jpg","tmdbId":4220753}],"writers":[{"name":"Lee Do-yoon","character":"Lee Do-yoon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/1UJlE6RqWPEOhdwoQnB0L0SI5Ze.jpg","tmdbId":3383332},{"name":"이낙준","character":"이낙준","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/6IxgSS99yYj8Mk6xLMy0EwZNrBP.jpg","tmdbId":3329684}],"certification":"TV-MA","seasonPosters":["https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hqDd6kgvfFBoQiI25ueWBvU4C0.jpg",null]},"behaviorHints":{"hasScheduledVideos":true},"videos":[{"id":"tt28106730:1:1","season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Llega el nuevo jefe","overview":"Baek Kang‑hyuk llega al Hospital Universitario de Hankuk para revitalizar la Unidad de Trauma. Sus primeros casos son un apuñalamiento y un accidente de senderismo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jQ90rX9TnNGEls4mc0yYJK2z8d.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:2","season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Nace el primer protegido","overview":"Durante un arriesgado rescate en helicóptero, Kang‑hyuk y Yang Jae‑won intentan operar en pleno vuelo. Mientras empieza la amistad de ambos, Kang‑hyuk y Han Yu‑rim chocan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lyjEWn3z0OyAObWCdVJS9i9QnFT.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:3","season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Seguir corriendo","overview":"Un choque automovilístico deja pacientes en estado crítico. Kang‑hyuk y Jae‑won deben lidiar con un caso de trasplante muy delicado, mientras enfrentan el rechazo de sus colegas.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q0V44N0ARpSIj2HZO2UmSCrSowo.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Más cerca de lo que creemos","overview":"En medio de una polémica reunión presupuestaria, Kang‑hyuk sale a salvar a una paciente cercana a Jae‑won y Yu‑rim. Más tarde, escucha un inquietante rumor sobre su pasado.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkzYVtgC5N3AWL1vUT0ky4X5rwm.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Código negro","overview":"Mientras enfrenta la burla mediática, Kang‑hyuk lidia con un desastre para el que será necesario todo el personal. Jae‑won realiza su primera cirugía de emergencia.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/llQxArk2PD5q27r3u5xnzCEl5Lv.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"47 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Razones para no rendirse","overview":"El ambiente político se agrava, pero Kang‑hyuk sigue firmemente enfocado en los pacientes. Mientras tanto, Cheon Jang‑mi intenta animar al decaído Jae‑won.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cF8adELC7A8CxFaUwrP3fL9WXtt.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"48 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Pedido de auxilio","overview":"Kang-hyuk enfrenta una investigación por mala praxis, tiene un paciente en estado crítico y debe defender su reputación. Más tarde, sale del país por un caso muy especial.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fJG2w1WBwpUSYR0taX2xFsyFbIr.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"53 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Paciente: Baek Kang‑hyuk","overview":"En medio de las balas, Kang‑hyuk logra que su equipo salve a un capitán del ejército. De vuelta en Corea, su vida queda en manos de sus aprendices.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9YUHFcGHmUPMSIHKLTznBftaeql.jpg","released":"2025-01-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"55 min"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:1","season":2,"episode":1,"title":"Episodio 1"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:2","season":2,"episode":2,"title":"Episodio 2"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:3","season":2,"episode":3,"title":"Episodio 3"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:4","season":2,"episode":4,"title":"Episodio 4"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:5","season":2,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:6","season":2,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:7","season":2,"episode":7,"title":"Episodio 7"},{"id":"tt28106730:2:8","season":2,"episode":8,"title":"Episodio 8"}]}}